@DeepSeek teams, why not train your next series of LLM models with source-aware training?
https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.01019
LLM's would be able to answer questions, delineating exactly which facts/assumptions/reasonings are prior work and from where (this URL, that book, etc.),  and which parts are it's own deductions, or the user's.
